{{#if (eq ../requirement "art-4")}}
== Requirement

The providers and the deployers of AI systems take measures so that their staff, and the other people who use AI systems on their behalf, have a sufficient level of AI literacy. The measures take into account the technical knowledge, the experience, the education, and the training of the people, and the context in which the AI systems are used.

The obligation applies from 2 February 2025, to every organisation that uses AI systems in its work.

This is a summary. See the regulation for the exact text, and check whether it has been amended.

